  "duration_s": 371.147007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "父亲三十三岁，唱着歌就义，儿子九十六岁，守着大海，走一门，两忠恋家。人们今天这个故事讲的不是一个人，是两代人。父亲正值三十三岁，高唱着国际歌走向刑场，为的是让老百姓翻身做主人。儿子四岁成了孤儿，九十六岁离世前还在念叨，参数核对好了什么，为的是让中国挺直腰杆，父子俩一个倒在黎明前，一个奋斗了一辈子。两代人的命，给新中国筑起了两道屏障。父亲叫彭湃共产党早期领导人之一。领导过轰轰烈烈的农民运动，是老百姓心里的大英雄。一九二九年，他在上海被捕，临行行前，高唱国际歌，慷慨赴死。那一年，他的小儿子彭士禄才四岁，四岁的孩子对父母的记忆就剩一张老照片。照片上，父亲抱着他亲手写了一行字，澎湃及他的小乖乖，多好的字，多狠的世道。彭时路三岁那年，母亲蔡素萍被捕就医，一夜之间，他没了爹没了妈，还成了敌人妖。斩草除根的目标是海丰的老百姓硬拿命护住了这个孩子。东家给塞一口红薯，西家给补一件旧衣，二十多户人家轮流藏他。八岁那年，他还是被抓进了监狱，被吊起来打，被折磨，双腿烂得站不起来。十岁出狱，他沿着铁路爬了十几公里，膝盖磨的血肉模糊，才爬回养母家。一个烈士的孩子，本该在父母怀里长大，却把童年活成了刀尖上的行走。一九四零年，周恩来总理派人辗转找到他，握着他的手说，孩子终于找到你了。十五岁的彭适路被送到延安，这才算有了家。后来他考取留宿资格，去苏联学化工。一九五六年陈赓大将问他，国家要搞核动力，需要你改行，你愿意吗？他说，只要祖国需要我，我愿意贡献一切。从此，他像父亲一样，把一切都献给了国家，只是换了一种方式。父亲轰轰烈烈走向历史舞台。中央，他悄无声息的深浅，一切就是三十年。在四川的深山里，他带着几百号人用算盘和计算尺算出了十几万个核动力数据。一九七零年八月三十日反应堆达到满功率，他五天五夜没合眼。同年十二月，中国第一艘核潜艇下水，中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。一九七四年，他未穿孔，未被切除了四分之三，可核潜艇搞成了，他又转身去搞核电站。大亚湾秦山、中国核电从无到有，都踩着他的脚印。二零一七年，九十二岁的他拿到一百万港币的科技大奖，一分不留全捐给国家培养年轻人。女儿还劝他留点儿，他说，这钱是国家的，我一分都不能动。二零二一年三月，九十六岁的彭时路在北京逝世。临终前，他还在念叨参数核对好了吗？他的骨灰按照遗愿洒进了大海，他要陪着核潜艇，守着这片海。家人们，你品品这两代人，父亲澎湃，三十三岁就义，为的是老百姓的解放。儿子彭世路，九十六岁离世，为的是祖国的强盛一门。两忠列两代报国心，父亲那一辈用热血换来了新中国。儿子。这一辈用一辈子守住了新中国的安宁。今天我们能安安稳稳过日子，能挺直腰杆，说话背后就是彭老这样的。用隐姓埋名的一辈子给我们撑起了保护伞。彭时录生前常说，我这辈子顶多算一颗螺丝钉，可正是这一颗颗螺丝钉，拧出了中国的核潜艇，拧出了中国的核电站，拧出了咱们今天的底气。有人说，英雄都活在书里。电影里家人们彭家父子俩告诉你，英雄就活在我们身边，活在这片土地里，觉得这个家族了不起的评论区打两代报国四个字，致敬。这对父子致敬所有为国家默默付出的人像彭老这样的故事，国之吉梁。这本书里还有四十位，喜欢的朋友可以直接拍链接。我放在视频左下角了，没事的时候翻一翻，遇到心里过不去的时候也看一看，是不是也就过得去了。关注我，把帮你拆解历史名人背后的故事、厚重乏味的历史经我的讲解，让你耳目一新。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1470,
      "text": "父亲三十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1750,
      "end_ms": 2970,
      "text": "唱着歌就义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3370,
      "end_ms": 4710,
      "text": "儿子九十六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5010,
      "end_ms": 5850,
      "text": "守着大海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5850,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "走一门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7050,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "两忠恋家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8890,
      "end_ms": 12490,
      "text": "人们今天这个故事讲的不是一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 13750,
      "text": "是两代人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14230,
      "end_ms": 16790,
      "text": "父亲正值三十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17250,
      "end_ms": 19910,
      "text": "高唱着国际歌走向刑场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20310,
      "end_ms": 22850,
      "text": "为的是让老百姓翻身做主人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23450,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "儿子四岁成了孤儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25590,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "九十六岁离世前还在念叨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28790,
      "end_ms": 30420,
      "text": "参数核对好了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30840,
      "end_ms": 33400,
      "text": "为的是让中国挺直腰杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34360,
      "end_ms": 37300,
      "text": "父子俩一个倒在黎明前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38180,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "一个奋斗了一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39980,
      "end_ms": 41000,
      "text": "两代人的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41360,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "给新中国筑起了两道屏障。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44880,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "父亲叫彭湃共产党早期领导人之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50020,
      "end_ms": 52680,
      "text": "领导过轰轰烈烈的农民运动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52940,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "是老百姓心里的大英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56260,
      "end_ms": 57220,
      "text": "一九二九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57420,
      "end_ms": 58660,
      "text": "他在上海被捕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 58960,
      "end_ms": 59800,
      "text": "临行行前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 60280,
      "end_ms": 61480,
      "text": "高唱国际歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 61700,
      "end_ms": 62785,
      "text": "慷慨赴死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 63580,
      "end_ms": 64175,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 64510,
      "end_ms": 66985,
      "text": "他的小儿子彭士禄才四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67800,
      "end_ms": 72785,
      "text": "四岁的孩子对父母的记忆就剩一张老照片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 73200,
      "end_ms": 73860,
      "text": "照片上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 74080,
      "end_ms": 76915,
      "text": "父亲抱着他亲手写了一行字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 77730,
      "end_ms": 79550,
      "text": "澎湃及他的小乖乖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 79590,
      "end_ms": 80395,
      "text": "多好的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 80990,
      "end_ms": 82125,
      "text": "多狠的世道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 83280,
      "end_ms": 84735,
      "text": "彭时路三岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 85150,
      "end_ms": 87495,
      "text": "母亲蔡素萍被捕就医，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 88310,
      "end_ms": 89055,
      "text": "一夜之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 89870,
      "end_ms": 91775,
      "text": "他没了爹没了妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 92230,
      "end_ms": 93505,
      "text": "还成了敌人妖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 93810,
      "end_ms": 99995,
      "text": "斩草除根的目标是海丰的老百姓硬拿命护住了这个孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 100950,
      "end_ms": 102715,
      "text": "东家给塞一口红薯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103080,
      "end_ms": 105265,
      "text": "西家给补一件旧衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105650,
      "end_ms": 108035,
      "text": "二十多户人家轮流藏他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109520,
      "end_ms": 110405,
      "text": "八岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 110860,
      "end_ms": 113165,
      "text": "他还是被抓进了监狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 113500,
      "end_ms": 114460,
      "text": "被吊起来打，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 114580,
      "end_ms": 115365,
      "text": "被折磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 115780,
      "end_ms": 117360,
      "text": "双腿烂得站不起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 117640,
      "end_ms": 118620,
      "text": "十岁出狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 118640,
      "end_ms": 121095,
      "text": "他沿着铁路爬了十几公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 121540,
      "end_ms": 123965,
      "text": "膝盖磨的血肉模糊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 124580,
      "end_ms": 125945,
      "text": "才爬回养母家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 126800,
      "end_ms": 128135,
      "text": "一个烈士的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 128470,
      "end_ms": 130095,
      "text": "本该在父母怀里长大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 130510,
      "end_ms": 133425,
      "text": "却把童年活成了刀尖上的行走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 134240,
      "end_ms": 135165,
      "text": "一九四零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 135470,
      "end_ms": 137855,
      "text": "周恩来总理派人辗转找到他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 138330,
      "end_ms": 139345,
      "text": "握着他的手说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 140230,
      "end_ms": 143145,
      "text": "孩子终于找到你了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 144350,
      "end_ms": 147555,
      "text": "十五岁的彭适路被送到延安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 148450,
      "end_ms": 149515,
      "text": "这才算有了家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 150180,
      "end_ms": 152325,
      "text": "后来他考取留宿资格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152660,
      "end_ms": 154225,
      "text": "去苏联学化工。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 155200,
      "end_ms": 158480,
      "text": "一九五六年陈赓大将问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 158480,
      "end_ms": 159885,
      "text": "国家要搞核动力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 160410,
      "end_ms": 161470,
      "text": "需要你改行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 161790,
      "end_ms": 162625,
      "text": "你愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 163440,
      "end_ms": 163985,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 164730,
      "end_ms": 166545,
      "text": "只要祖国需要我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 166940,
      "end_ms": 168365,
      "text": "我愿意贡献一切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 168870,
      "end_ms": 169425,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 169720,
      "end_ms": 170880,
      "text": "他像父亲一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 170940,
      "end_ms": 173245,
      "text": "把一切都献给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 173770,
      "end_ms": 175135,
      "text": "只是换了一种方式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 175650,
      "end_ms": 178530,
      "text": "父亲轰轰烈烈走向历史舞台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 178530,
      "end_ms": 178925,
      "text": "中央，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 179810,
      "end_ms": 181995,
      "text": "他悄无声息的深浅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 182860,
      "end_ms": 184515,
      "text": "一切就是三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 185120,
      "end_ms": 186675,
      "text": "在四川的深山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 187050,
      "end_ms": 194515,
      "text": "他带着几百号人用算盘和计算尺算出了十几万个核动力数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 195340,
      "end_ms": 198875,
      "text": "一九七零年八月三十日反应堆达到满功率，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 199300,
      "end_ms": 200995,
      "text": "他五天五夜没合眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 201420,
      "end_ms": 202635,
      "text": "同年十二月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 202990,
      "end_ms": 205135,
      "text": "中国第一艘核潜艇下水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 205580,
      "end_ms": 209765,
      "text": "中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 210380,
      "end_ms": 211275,
      "text": "一九七四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 211560,
      "end_ms": 212585,
      "text": "他未穿孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 213060,
      "end_ms": 214795,
      "text": "未被切除了四分之三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 215340,
      "end_ms": 216895,
      "text": "可核潜艇搞成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 217130,
      "end_ms": 219325,
      "text": "他又转身去搞核电站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 223725,
      "text": "大亚湾秦山、中国核电从无到有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 224320,
      "end_ms": 225745,
      "text": "都踩着他的脚印。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 226680,
      "end_ms": 227685,
      "text": "二零一七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 228510,
      "end_ms": 232675,
      "text": "九十二岁的他拿到一百万港币的科技大奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 233630,
      "end_ms": 237055,
      "text": "一分不留全捐给国家培养年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 237280,
      "end_ms": 238735,
      "text": "女儿还劝他留点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 239620,
      "end_ms": 240185,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 241070,
      "end_ms": 242205,
      "text": "这钱是国家的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 243190,
      "end_ms": 244355,
      "text": "我一分都不能动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 245450,
      "end_ms": 246905,
      "text": "二零二一年三月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 247390,
      "end_ms": 250355,
      "text": "九十六岁的彭时路在北京逝世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 251330,
      "end_ms": 252165,
      "text": "临终前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 252920,
      "end_ms": 256045,
      "text": "他还在念叨参数核对好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 256550,
      "end_ms": 260205,
      "text": "他的骨灰按照遗愿洒进了大海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 260910,
      "end_ms": 262365,
      "text": "他要陪着核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 262720,
      "end_ms": 263765,
      "text": "守着这片海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 264870,
      "end_ms": 265345,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 265870,
      "end_ms": 267745,
      "text": "你品品这两代人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 268230,
      "end_ms": 269505,
      "text": "父亲澎湃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 269990,
      "end_ms": 271565,
      "text": "三十三岁就义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 272010,
      "end_ms": 273645,
      "text": "为的是老百姓的解放。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 274130,
      "end_ms": 275105,
      "text": "儿子彭世路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 275670,
      "end_ms": 276930,
      "text": "九十六岁离世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 277090,
      "end_ms": 279940,
      "text": "为的是祖国的强盛一门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 280120,
      "end_ms": 282595,
      "text": "两忠列两代报国心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 283580,
      "end_ms": 287025,
      "text": "父亲那一辈用热血换来了新中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 287530,
      "end_ms": 288010,
      "text": "儿子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 288010,
      "end_ms": 291965,
      "text": "这一辈用一辈子守住了新中国的安宁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 292710,
      "end_ms": 295335,
      "text": "今天我们能安安稳稳过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 295700,
      "end_ms": 296960,
      "text": "能挺直腰杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 296980,
      "end_ms": 299800,
      "text": "说话背后就是彭老这样的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 300470,
      "end_ms": 304465,
      "text": "用隐姓埋名的一辈子给我们撑起了保护伞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 305160,
      "end_ms": 306620,
      "text": "彭时录生前常说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 307120,
      "end_ms": 310340,
      "text": "我这辈子顶多算一颗螺丝钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 310900,
      "end_ms": 313020,
      "text": "可正是这一颗颗螺丝钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 313480,
      "end_ms": 315300,
      "text": "拧出了中国的核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 315440,
      "end_ms": 317100,
      "text": "拧出了中国的核电站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 317540,
      "end_ms": 319480,
      "text": "拧出了咱们今天的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 320400,
      "end_ms": 321040,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 321840,
      "end_ms": 323740,
      "text": "英雄都活在书里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 324380,
      "end_ms": 328820,
      "text": "电影里家人们彭家父子俩告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 330260,
      "end_ms": 333860,
      "text": "英雄就活在我们身边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 334400,
      "end_ms": 336510,
      "text": "活在这片土地里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 336510,
      "end_ms": 342090,
      "text": "觉得这个家族了不起的评论区打两代报国四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 342150,
      "end_ms": 342570,
      "text": "致敬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 342570,
      "end_ms": 349850,
      "text": "这对父子致敬所有为国家默默付出的人像彭老这样的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 349890,
      "end_ms": 350850,
      "text": "国之吉梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 350850,
      "end_ms": 353250,
      "text": "这本书里还有四十位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 353250,
      "end_ms": 355790,
      "text": "喜欢的朋友可以直接拍链接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 355790,
      "end_ms": 357770,
      "text": "我放在视频左下角了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 357770,
      "end_ms": 359490,
      "text": "没事的时候翻一翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 359490,
      "end_ms": 362010,
      "text": "遇到心里过不去的时候也看一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 362010,
      "end_ms": 363810,
      "text": "是不是也就过得去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 363810,
      "end_ms": 364530,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 364530,
      "end_ms": 369680,
      "text": "把帮你拆解历史名人背后的故事、厚重乏味的历史经我的讲解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3a37409c7955af4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 369700,
      "end_ms": 370965,
      "text": "让你耳目一新。"
    }
  ],
